1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,060
Dave: It's your turn, Mark. Roll the dice.

2
00:00:02,410 --> 00:00:05,660
Mark: Don't you get a feeling... when you watch him play like that?

3
00:00:06,160 --> 00:00:09,700
Dave: Wha... what? What do you mean?

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,120
Mark: The way he moves the pieces. The way he builds... that long road of his.

5
00:00:14,420 --> 00:00:19,600
Dave: He just placed two wooden sticks on a cardboard hexagon, Mark. Just... roll.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:27,230
Mark: Look at his grip on that Ore card. So dominant. He's cornering the entire mountain region and he doesn't even care who gets hurt. It's feral.

7
00:00:27,530 --> 00:00:33,080
Dave: He's playing a German board game. It's the least feral thing happening in this dorm right now.

8
00:00:33,580 --> 00:00:35,580
Bobby: I am upgrading my settlement to a city.

9
00:00:36,780 --> 00:00:41,410
Mark: Oh, my god. The infrastructure. The urban density. It's so thick.

10
00:00:41,660 --> 00:00:45,930
Dave: It's a block of painted pine. Stop... stop looking at him like that.

11
00:00:46,330 --> 00:00:57,160
Mark: Dave, look at his resource management. He traded three sheep for one brick at a generic port. The raw, masculine confidence to take a three to one loss just to establish dominance on the coastline. It's filthy.

12
00:00:57,460 --> 00:01:00,100
Bobby: I will now play a Knight card. I am moving the Robber.

13
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:06,780
Mark: Put it down. Yeah. Block that resource production. Choke his supply chain, you dirty boy.

14
00:01:07,080 --> 00:01:11,700
Dave: Mark, I'm physically uncomfortable, and Bobby hasn't blinked in four minutes.

15
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:14,940
Bobby: I demand one resource card from Dave. Blind pull.

16
00:01:15,940 --> 00:01:19,450
Mark: Take it from me instead. Take all my wood, Bobby. Take my wood!

17
00:01:20,050 --> 00:01:26,170
Dave: You just destroyed the board. That's it. I'm done. I am transferring to a different university.

18
00:01:27,670 --> 00:01:30,930
Bobby: You disrupted my trade route. I am going to dock your victory points.

19
00:01:31,830 --> 00:01:32,650
Mark: Punish me.
